# Shambling Ghast: "When this creature dies, choose one - target creature an opponent controls gets -1/-1 until end of
# turn." Bot1 casts the Ghast for exactly {B} from Mox Jet (pool empty right after), and Bot2 kills it with Lightning Bolt
# on turn 2. The trigger offers Bot2's Ornithopter and refuses Bot1's own Ornithopter (not an opponent's) and Bot2's
# Mox Ruby (not a creature), and leaves its Aunt May (0/2, not chosen) alone; the 0/2 Ornithopter becomes -1/1 and lives (a -2/-2 would kill it), and is 0/2 again on
# turn 3 once cleanup has ended the effect (CR 514.2).

